# The language bar should describe what this project is, not be tuned until it
# flatters. Python is the tool; YAML is the action, the hook and the workflows,
# which are a real part of what this repository ships and stay counted.
#
# What is excluded is documentation and test data, which is what Linguist's
# categories are for.
*.md linguist-documentation
docs/** linguist-documentation

# Fixtures are Sigma rules written to be wrong in one specific way. They are
# inputs to the tests, not YAML this project maintains as content.
tests/fixtures/** linguist-vendored

*.sarif linguist-generated
